---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="About | Kvisl" description="Kvisl is an independent, member-run nonprofit for sustained inquiry.">
  <main class="container page-main narrow-page">
    <p class="eyebrow">About <span class="notranslate" translate="no">Kvisl</span></p>
    <h1 class="page-title">To attend<br />is to inhabit.</h1>
    <p class="page-lede"><span class="notranslate" translate="no">Kvisl</span> is an independent, member-run nonprofit devoted to long-form inquiry. We publish deliberately, edit carefully, and make room for questions that reward sustained attention.</p>
    <div class="policy-copy">
      <p>Attention is more than looking. It means staying with a subject long enough for it to alter how we understand the world.</p>
      <p>We publish essays, research, and visual narratives across philosophy, science, nature, society, culture, and art.</p>
      <p>Our editorial and technical choices serve the same purpose: less noise and more room for thought.</p>
    </div>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
